abstract: >-
  Analysis code and coded data for the article "Plasma L-kynurenine levels are
  associated with resting-state cortical dynamics in episodic migraine". The
  repository holds the parcel time series of the 21 participants (Schaefer-100
  atlas), the scripts that denoise them, estimate the Hurst exponents and run
  the statistical analyses, and the resulting tables and figures. The clinical
  table needed for the statistics cannot be shared; see README.md.
